{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>From the El of your father.</b> This was yours, and He will help you." "<b>And with Shaddai.</b> Your heart was with the Holy One, blessed be He, when you did not heed the words of your mistress — and He will bless you." "<b>Blessing of breasts and womb.</b> The blessing of father and mother — that is, may those who beget and those who give birth be blessed: that the males emit seed fit for conception, and the females not miscarry the fruit of their womb to lose their fetuses." "<b>Breasts.</b> יָרֹה יִיָּרֶה — we translate אִשְׁתְּדָאָה יִשְׁתְּדִי; so too שָׁדַיִם here is named for the seed shooting forth like an arrow."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:16.292673059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}